What this repository contains
-----------------------------
- The router (multiplc/) and the backends in backends/ (Outseal, Haiwell,
  CODESYS, Sysmac Studio, Delta WPLSoft, Schneider Machine Expert Basic and
  any later in-repo backend). All of it is original work of the contributors.
- Empty project templates saved by a contributor with the vendor tool, with
  vendor-supplied preset comment texts and local paths removed:
  backends/haiwell/haiwell_mcp/templates/AT16S0T.gpc (Haiwell Happy V2.2.13),
  backends/delta/delta_mcp/templates/SS2.dvp (WPLSoft 2.52, DVP-SS2),
  backends/schneider/schneider_mcp/templates/TM221M16R.smbp (Machine Expert -
  Basic V1.3, TM221M16R). They contain no program logic, manual text or
  vendor sample.
- docs/demo/*.gif: screen recordings made by the contributors of their own
  test projects running in the vendors' software.
- Short technical facts needed for interoperability (menu names, file-format
  field names, numeric command IDs, compiler message texts). No vendor
  manuals, help files, libraries, DLLs, installers or sample projects are
  included or redistributed.

